action:
Use case: stylized-concept. Asset: transparent eight-frame full-body animation sheet for CANCEL CITY Copy-Paste Kakashi CC013. Official card image1 defines identity and gritty etched style; existing actor image2 defines entire clothing, proportions and ivory scroll-roll construction.
LAYOUT: exactly EIGHT isolated whole intact figures, TWO COLUMNS by FOUR ROWS on a portrait canvas. Every head spike, toe, hand and paper roll fully inside its own equal cell. Broad actual-transparent gutters between all figures, at least35pixels of clear padding around every figure, including outside canvas edges. Uniform figure scale, 3/4 view facing screen-right, camera level.
Identity: slim adult masked ninja with wildly spiky silver-white hair swept upwards, navy headband with tilted small silver forehead plate covering one eye, single visible tired sharp dark eye; dark navy cloth mask covers nose and mouth. Olive-green bulky pocketed flak vest over navy long-sleeve shirt with red spiral patch, navy loose cropped trousers, white thigh straps and white ankle wraps, navy open-toe ninja sandals, black/navy fingerless gloves with silver hand plates, brown diagonal chest strap. A large IVORY CYLINDRICAL PAPER ROLL/SCROLL with dark circular hollow core is strapped horizontally behind his shoulders in every pose. Paper roll blank, no lettering.
Style: current card's dense harsh scratched black etching, crosshatching, stippling, grotesque expressive visible eyebrow, lurid subtle magenta/cyan edge accents. Rugged ugly print texture, not clean anime, vector, smooth digital painting or glossy3D.
Eight poses reading left-to-right across each row:
1 ready with one hand on shoulder roll and the other low, tired confident visible eye;
2 first ninja hand gesture with both hands together at chest height;
3 second distinct ninja gesture, two fingers raised before face while other hand braces;
4 leans forward to screen-right with left palm at waist-high counter height, right hand on hip;
5 extends left index finger down at waist-high button height, head peers down to inspect;
6 recoils backwards from something offscreen-right, startled visible eye, both hands raised defensively;
7 attack lunge screen-right, front knee bent, right two-finger hand thrust, left hand maintains balance;
8 dismayed followthrough, shoulders slumped, palm turns up in disbelief and visible eye extremely unimpressed.
Actor ONLY, with strapped shoulder roll. Do NOT draw a photocopier or counter; poses4and5 will touch a separately composited machine. No clones, flying paper, paper ribbon, effects, smoke, lightning, aura, foreground props, floor, shadows, text, copyright symbols, labels, logo, border or watermark. All limbs connected naturally. Genuinely transparent background.

ending:
Use case: stylized-concept. Asset: second transparent full-body eight-pose sheet for Copy-Paste Kakashi CC013. Official card image1 gives rough scratched black etched style; action sheet image2 gives exact full-body identity, costume and shoulder scroll construction.
LAYOUT: PORTRAIT canvas, exactly TWO COLUMNS and FOUR ROWS, eight equal cells reading left-to-right each row. Eight separate whole figures, each entirely visible including every silver hair spike, both open-toe sandals and shoulder paper roll. Wide actual-transparent gutters and at least40pixels outer clear canvas margins. Make figures smaller if needed to keep all toes and hair complete. No touching figures, no clipping.
Same slim adult masked ninja: wildly spiky silver-white hair, navy headband with tilted silver plate over one eye, one tired dark visible eye, navy cloth mask fully covering nose and mouth. Olive-green pocketed flak vest over navy red-spiral-sleeve shirt, navy cropped loose pants, white thigh straps and ankle wraps, navy open-toe sandals, dark fingerless gloves and silver hand plates, brown diagonal chest strap. Large blank ivory cylindrical paper scroll with dark circular core strapped horizontally behind shoulders in every pose. Keep face, mask, proportions and colors absolutely consistent.
POSES:
1 points to something offscreen-right at waist height, visible eye stern, other hand on hip;
2 notices something impossible offscreen-right, body leans back and visible eye widens, right palm open;
3 confused head tilt, one hand scratches spiky hair, other on hip;
4 tries reversing a small WHITE INSTRUCTION SHEET held by both hands at chest level, paper tilted45degrees, eye peers down;
5 embarrassed slouch, one gloved palm covers visible eye, other hand holds small white sheet down by thigh;
6 arms folded in frustration, sharp annoyed visible eye, sheet tucked under folded arm;
7 holds instruction sheet upside-down at chest height with two hands, confused visible eye; paper has only two small crude geometric triangles and lines, absolutely NO words or symbols;
8 final deadpan straight stance, one hand holds folded small instruction sheet low, other palm up, tired unimpressed visible eye.
All paper sheets held and physically connected to hands; no loose flying papers. Current card's harsh dense scratch etching, crosshatched grungy ink, stipple, cheap print texture, slightly absurd expressions, magenta/cyan edge lights. Not clean vector, smooth anime, glossy3D, cute cartoon or painterly rendering. No photocopier, clone, ribbons, long paper trails, effects, lightning, smoke, aura, floor, cast shadow, background, text, copyright watermark, logos, labels or card frame. Genuinely transparent outside eight figures.
